    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>Since this morning I can&#39;t deploy any shinyaoos applicaiton.</div><div><br></div><div>More preceisely, when I try to deploy an applicaiton on <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360006846000&amp;usg=AOvVaw05dDGn8TY-vO_QFtJK-dbf\">shinyapps.io</a>, I get the error &quot; <b>[Errno 28] No space left on device</b>&quot;</div><div><br></div><div>Here is an example with the deails log :</div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#606\">Preparing</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> to deploy application</span><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span><span style=\"color:#000\">DONE<br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Uploading</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> bundle </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> application</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">303980.</span><span style=\"color:#660\">..</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Detecting</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> system locale </span><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> DONE<br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Deploying</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> bundle</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1285879</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> application</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">303980</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Waiting</span><span style=\"color:#000